      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The world capacity you see in the menu only applies for dropped portals. When joining through your friends list the max capacity is double the set number. (Ex: in a two people world, up to four people can join through invite, but a fifth user will get a connection error and sent back to their home.)\nNo idea if this is intended or not, but thats how it is...",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
