      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As far as I know, there is no limit on how many players can connect to a single instance. The \"player limit\", when uploading a world, is for how many players can go through a portal. Once the limit is filled the portal will close and another cannot be dropped until there are less than the set limit. If the limit is \"reached\" players can still invite as many players as they choose, depending on the instance type (friends, friends+, etc.)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
