      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b77714bc11e8156cccddf06|full_name}: The limit defined in the world settings is a soft limit. Once an instance reaches soft limit capacity, it will show \"FULL/XX\" in the preview and that instance will no longer show up in the public instances list. The hard limit is twice the soft limit, once that's reached, users will be dropped into another instance of the same world.\nThis behavior is intended.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
